th stone or sand surrounding the pool, and the soft fabric of the lounge furniture.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"350\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/partners/hotel-partners/marriott-banner-1920x350-dark.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=8ed756ea16c54237b132bb7434a1f0ce&amp;hash=07921041EE1F7D7F0D557223ADBE4D1A\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"d82af6fe-40cc-4d42-9d6f-dacfff1cd746\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Marriott Bonvoy</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"container main-content details-page\">\n  <div class=\"col-12 field-section1\">\n    <h2 class=\"fs-1-5 vg-0--top\">About the partner</h2>\n    <p>Welcome to Marriott Bonvoy, Marriott International's award-winning travel program, offering renowned hospitality in over 10,000 global destinations across 30 extraordinary hotel brands.</p>\n    <p>Unlock access to unparalleled travel benefits including free nights, room upgrades, and world-class experiences through Marriott Bonvoy Moments.</p>\n    <p>As a Marriott Bonvoy member, you can transfer your points to AlFursan Reward Miles. Not a member? <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/createAccount/createAccountPage1.mi?enrollmentSourceCode=AABJ\" target=\"_blank\">Join for free</a></p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Miles to earn</h3>\n    <p>Earn up to 2 Miles for every $1 spent, or convert your Marriott Bonvoy points to AlFursan Miles:</p>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Earn 5,000 Reward Miles for every 60,000 points converted.</li>\n      <li>Earn 1 Reward Mile for every 3 Marriott Bonvoy points.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/redeem/travel/points-to-miles.mi\" class=\"saudia-btn saudia-btn--primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"External link\">Convert now</a>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">How to earn Miles</h3>\n    <p>It is now easy for you to earn Reward Miles for stays at hotels and resorts participating in the Marriott Bonvoy program*.</p>\n    <p>If you prefer to earn Reward Miles rather than Marriott Bonvoy points, please follow these steps:</p>\n    <ol class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--ordered\">\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/createAccount/createAccountPage1.mi?enrollmentSourceCode=AABJ\" target=\"_blank\">Join now</a> or <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/default.mi\" target=\"_blank\">sign in</a> to your Marriott Bonvoy membership account.</li>\n      <li>Select “Profile”.</li>\n      <li>Click “Edit” within “Earning Preferences”.</li>\n      <li>Select Miles as your preferred currency.</li>\n      <li>Choose “Saudia” and enter your AlFursan membership number.</li>\n      <li>Click “Submit”.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Earn 2 Miles for every $1 spent</h3>\n    <p>Earn 2 Miles for every $1 spent on all qualifying charges during qualified stays at the following brands:</p>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>The Ritz-Carlton®</li>\n      <li>JW Marriott®</li>\n      <li>EDITION®</li>\n      <li>Autograph Collection® Hotels</li>\n      <li>Renaissance® Hotels</li>\n      <li>Marriott Hotels®</li>\n      <li>Marriott Vacation Club®</li>\n      <li>Gaylord Hotels®</li>\n      <li>Delta Hotels by Marriott™</li>\n      <li>Design Hotels™*</li>\n      <li>Le Méridien®</li>\n      <li>The Luxury Collection®</li>\n      <li>Sheraton®</li>\n      <li>St. Regis®</li>\n      <li>Tribute Portfolio®</li>\n      <li>W® Hotels</li>\n      <li>Westin®</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Earn 1 Mile for every $1 spent</h3>\n    <p>Earn 1 Mile for every $1 spent on all qualifying charges during qualified stays at the following brands:</p>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Courtyard by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>Fairfield® by Marriott</li>\n      <li>SpringHill Suites by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>Residence Inn by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>TownePlace Suites by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>Marriott Executive Apartments®</li>\n      <li>AC Hotels by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>MOXY® Hotels</li>\n      <li>Protea Hotels by Marriott®</li>\n      <li>Aloft®</li>\n      <li>Element by Westin®</li>\n      <li>Four Points® by Sheraton</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>*All hotels and resorts participating in the Marriott Bonvoy program are <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/terms/default.mi\" target=\"_blank\">listed here</a>.</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Terms and conditions</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Please check the <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/terms/default.mi\" target=\"_blank\">terms and conditions</a> specific to Marriott Bonvoy.</li>\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/help/useful-links/legal-and-terms-and-conditions/terms-and-conditions\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and conditions</a> specific to the AlFursan program apply.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Claim missing Miles</h3>\n    <p>If it has been more than 10 business days following a completed stay and Marriott Bonvoy points or Miles are missing from your account, please submit a <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/loyalty/myAccount/missingStayRequest.mi\" target=\"_blank\">missing stay request</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}